            "heading": "What is your returns policy?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer a 60-day return policy for your peace of mind. If your purchase was made within the last 60 days, you can return it for a refund. To be eligible, items must be unopened, unused, and in their original, re-saleable condition, including all tamper-resistant seals, packaging, and cellophane intact. For detailed information, please visit our page.<br/><br/></p>",
