          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I return a faulty, incorrect, or damaged item?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>In the rare event that you receive a defective, incorrect, or damaged item (that wasn't advertised as such), Once you receive it, please print and attach the label to your package and drop it off at your local post office. To help us process claims for damages, we may request photographic evidence. For detailed information, please visit our page.<br/><br/></p>",
